nch **planner** and **implementation/validation** sub-agents in parallel (no model override, as instructed).\n","signature":"a53997c778f04a158f347cafe25edd5e"}],"model":"unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-NVFP4","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":83585,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1e185180-d3b4-4221-b75d-dd2530f25a87","uuid":"9366eb5a-0b5c-413f-9902-1d17b52eefbe","timestamp":"2026-08-20T11:59:51.162Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"chatcmpl-9e06c418e7719130","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"chatcmpl-tool-8513b13c4574fc87","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"planner: plan STORY-setup-001a","prompt":"You are an expert planning specialist focused on creating comprehensive, actionable implementation plans.\n\n## Your Role\n\n- Analyze requirements and create detailed implementation plans\n- Break down complex features into manageable steps\n- Identify dependencies and potential risks\n- Suggest optimal implementation order\n- Consider edge cases and error scenarios\n\n## Planning Process\n\n1. **Requirements Analysis** — Understand the feature request completely; identify success criteria; list assumptions and constraints.\n2. **Architecture Review** — Analyze existing codebase structure; identify affected components; consider reusable patterns.\n3. **Step Breakdown** — Create detailed steps with clear specific actions, file paths, dependencies, complexity, and risks.\n4. **Implementation Order** — Prioritize by dependencies; group related changes; enable incremental testing.\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. Be Specific: use exact file paths, function names, version numbers.\n2. Consider Edge Cases: error scenarios, null values, empty states.\n3. Minimize Changes: prefer extending existing code over rewriting.\n4. Maintain Patterns: follow existing project conventions.\n5. Enable Testing: structure changes to be easily testable.\n6. Think Incrementally: each step must be verifiable.\n7. Document Decisions: explain why, not just what.\n\nRed flags to check: missing error handling, hardcoded values, missing tests, steps without clear file paths, plans with no testing strategy.\n\n--- TASK ---\n\nWorkspace (absolute path, work here): /home/nitin-sharma/ralph-workspaces/6896163a-932b-4b96-bfe9-cdbb022c3538/c7df6267-784a-460a-addd-6d781a21b6f5\n\nStory: STORY-setup-001a — \"Create Root NextMove package.json With Workspaces\". Crea